      equipment: 'Score sheet for cumulative target race.',
      dealing: 'Start play pile with four face-up stacked cards (only top visible), deal four cards to each player, and keep remainder as face-down stock for future 4-card redeals.',
    },
    turnFlow: "Play begins with player to dealer's right and proceeds counterclockwise. On turn, play exactly one card from hand. If its rank matches the top of any table pile (central play pile or any capture pile), take that top card plus any immediately underlying equal-rank cards and place them on top of your capture pile. If no match exists, place played card on top of central play pile. After all players exhaust current 4-card hands, dealer gives another 4 to each if stock remains. Continue until stock and hands are empty.",
